{"metadata":{"title":"Custom Views","roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"role":"collectionGroup"},"abstract":[{"text":"Build your own views by composing existing ones or creating custom view modifiers.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit offers two ways to create custom views:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Approach"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to Use"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Complexity","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Composite View"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/View","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Combining existing views into reusable components","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Low","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"View Modifier","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewModifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Transforming any view’s rendered buffer (padding, background)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Medium","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most custom views should be "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"composite views"}]},{"type":"text","text":". For buffer-level transformations, implement a custom "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewModifier","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Composite Views","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Composite-Views"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A composite view implements the ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property to compose existing views. This is the same pattern as SwiftUI:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["struct StatusHeader: View {","    let title: String","    let version: String","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            HStack {","                Text(title)","                    .bold()","                    .foregroundColor(.palette.accent)","                Spacer()","                Text(\"v\\(version)\")","                    .foregroundColor(.palette.foregroundTertiary)","            }","            Divider()","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property is annotated with ","type":"text"},{"code":"@ViewBuilder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at the protocol level, so you can use all result builder features: conditionals, optionals, loops:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["struct UserCard: View {","    let name: String","    let role: String?","","    var body: some View {","        Panel(title: name) {","            Text(name).bold()","            if let role {","                Text(role)","                    .foregroundColor(.palette.foregroundSecondary)","                    .italic()","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Accepting Child Content","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Accepting-Child-Content"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To create container-style views that accept child content, use a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@ViewBuilder"},{"type":"text","text":" closure parameter:"}]},{"code":["struct Section<Content: View>: View {","    let title: String","    let content: Content","","    init(title: String, @ViewBuilder content: () -> Content) {","        self.title = title","        self.content = content()","    }","","    var body: some View {","        VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            Text(title)","                .bold()","                .underline()","            content","        }","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage","Section(title: \"Settings\") {","    Text(\"Option A\")","    Text(\"Option B\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Building Custom Containers","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Building-Custom-Containers"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For richer containers, compose existing container views like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Panel","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Card","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Dialog","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":["struct SettingsGroup<Content: View>: View {","    let title: String","    let content: Content","","    init(_ title: String, @ViewBuilder content: () -> Content) {","        self.title = title","        self.content = content()","    }","","    var body: some View {","        Panel(title, borderStyle: .rounded, titleColor: .palette.accent) {","            content","        }","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage","SettingsGroup(\"Network\") {","    Text(\"Proxy: none\")","    Text(\"DNS: auto\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"View Modifiers","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"View-Modifiers"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewModifier"},{"text":" transforms an already-rendered ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FrameBuffer"},{"text":". Use this when your transformation operates on the output of any view:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["struct IndentModifier: ViewModifier {","    let columns: Int","","    func modify(buffer: FrameBuffer, context: RenderContext) -> FrameBuffer {","        var result = FrameBuffer(","            emptyWithWidth: max(0, columns),","            height: buffer.height","        )","        if !buffer.isEmpty {","            result.appendHorizontally(buffer)","        }","        return result","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply it using ","type":"text"},{"code":".modifier(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["Text(\"Indented\")","    .modifier(IndentModifier(columns: 2))"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Convenience Extensions","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Convenience-Extensions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For a cleaner API, add a ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extension:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["extension View {","    func indented(_ columns: Int = 2) -> some View {","        modifier(IndentModifier(columns: columns))","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage","Text(\"Indented\").indented(4)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"When to Use ViewModifier","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"When-to-Use-ViewModifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewModifier"},{"text":" when your transformation is a pure buffer-to-buffer operation: adding visual effects, changing backgrounds, or adjusting layout after rendering. The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderCo